      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 3.98,
          "en": "Now transition cannot just be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.98,
          "end": 6.67,
          "en": "with the transition CSS property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.67,
          "end": 8.22,
          "en": "just to make this clear,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.22,
          "end": 11.77,
          "en": "you can also use it to apply an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.77,
          "end": 13.91,
          "en": "Now we already have an animation here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.91,
          "end": 17.34,
          "en": "slide and fade, it's actually not really fading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 21.02,
          "en": "I guess it's more of a slide and scale animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.02,
          "end": 23.29,
          "en": "So maybe let's use this as a name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.29,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "And let me show you how we could add this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 28.903,
          "en": "with this transition wrapper component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.9,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "So on this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 34.75,
          "en": "I mentioned that view would add these special",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.75,
          "end": 38.21,
          "en": "CSS classes v-enter-from and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.21,
          "end": 41.05,
          "en": "Now, if you don't want to use this transition way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.05,
          "end": 42.51,
          "en": "because maybe you have a more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.51,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "complex animation with different steps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 47.2,
          "en": "you can do this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.2,
          "end": 50.15,
          "en": "Now we don't need all classes in that case though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.15,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "we don't need v-enter-from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 54.13,
          "en": "because we have no starting state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.13,
          "end": 55.91,
          "en": "and we have no end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.91,
          "end": 58.57,
          "en": "Instead, it's all defined in the animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.57,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "So in the end, we just have animation in v-enter-active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 66.52,
          "en": "Then I point at the slide-scale animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.52,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "to find the duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 70.883,
          "en": "which you will read as you learned and ease-out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.56,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "You don't even need four words here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "because you need to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 80.87,
          "en": "that all those special classes are being removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.87,
          "end": 82.34,
          "en": "once the animation is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.34,
          "end": 85.753,
          "en": "So once this duration which Vue reads is over,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.84,
          "end": 89.45,
          "en": "and therefore the final end state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.45,
          "end": 92.9,
          "en": "you will see on the screen is just a regular styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.9,
          "end": 94.49000000000001,
          "en": "you defined for this element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.49000000000001,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "with the other CSS rules you have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.16,
          "en": "So here we don't need four words",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.16,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "because this class is also getting removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 103.22999999999999,
          "en": "once the animation is over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.22999999999999,
          "end": 106.43,
          "en": "so it can't jump back because it doesn't even know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.43,
          "end": 109.40299999999999,
          "en": "the animation anymore once it is, well, over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 113,
          "en": "Now we can do the same for a leaving though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113,
          "end": 118,
          "en": "Don't need a from state, don't need a to state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.06,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "but for v-leave-active of instead of transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.75,
          "end": 125.75,
          "en": "We can use animations slide-scale .3 seconds ease-out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 131.11,
          "en": "If we now save that and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.11,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "Now we got this other style here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 136.48,
          "en": "Now it's the style from the square from before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.48,
          "end": 138.31,
          "en": "That's why it looks a bit strange here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.31,
          "end": 140.2,
          "en": "but you can tell that it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.2,
          "end": 143.53,
          "en": "So using CSS animations with the wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.53,
          "end": 146.823,
          "en": "with this transition wrapper component is also supported.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
